@host = http://localhost:5102

### Create a job
POST {{host}}/jobs
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Senior .NET Engineer",
  "description": "Build microservices on Azure.",
  "location": "Remote"
}

### List all jobs
GET {{host}}/jobs

### Get a job by id (replace the id)
GET {{host}}/jobs/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

### Update a job (replace the id)
PUT {{host}}/jobs/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Staff .NET Engineer",
  "description": "Build microservices on Azure.",
  "location": "Hybrid"
}

### Health check
GET {{host}}/health
